&FORCE_EVAL
   METHOD QUICKSTEP
   &SUBSYS
      &KIND H
         BASIS_SET TZV2P-MOLOPT-PBE-GTH-q1
         POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q1
         RADIAL_GRID 50
         LEBEDEV_GRID 50
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.0
      &END KIND
      &KIND C
         BASIS_SET TZV2P-MOLOPT-PBE-GTH-q4
         POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q4
         RADIAL_GRID 50
         LEBEDEV_GRID 50
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.52
      &END KIND
      &TOPOLOGY
         &CENTER_COORDINATES
         &END CENTER_COORDINATES
      &END TOPOLOGY
      &COORD
         C        0.2967800003        0.1283999976       -2.5597500002
